    card title "Months and dates"

A: How do you say a date in Russian, like the first of May, or the month of your birthday?
    draw cal cal_date

A: Ма́я here is май, May, in a form we'll come back to. First, all twelve months.
    highlight cal_date color #c9871a part ма́я effect underline

    erase intro

B: Янва́рь, февра́ль, март, апре́ль.
    draw m_jan m_feb m_mar m_apr parallel true

B: Май, ию́нь, ию́ль, а́вгуст.
    draw m_may m_jun m_jul m_aug parallel true

B: Сентя́брь, октя́брь, ноя́брь, дека́брь.
    draw m_sep m_oct m_nov m_dec parallel true

A: Like the days, they're written small, and every one of them is он.
    draw caps

    erase caps

    draw p1

A: In a month is в with the place ending е, as in в Москве́: в ма́рте, в а́вгусте.
    highlight m_mar m_aug color #c9871a

    draw p2

B: A soft sign or a й gives way to that е: в январе́, в ма́е.
    highlight m_jan m_may color #c9871a

    erase p1 p2

    hide grid

A: For the date, Russians ask: Како́е сего́дня число́? What number is today?
    draw q

B: Сего́дня пе́рвое ма́я.
    draw ans

    hide ans

    show ans_o

A: Пе́рвое means first. It ends in ое, like но́вое, because число́ is оно́.
    highlight q color #c9871a part число́ effect underline

B: Then второ́е, from второ́й, as in вто́рник; тре́тье, which ends in ье; and четвёртое.
    draw o1 o2 o3 o4 parallel true

A: Learn each one with its stress: пя́тое, восьмо́е, деся́тое, двадца́тое.
    draw o5 o8 o10 o20 parallel true

    erase ords1 ords2

B: In a long number only the last word changes, as with the years: три́дцать пе́рвое.
    draw o31

    erase o31

    hide ans_o

    show ans_og

A: Then the month takes the of-ending, as in кни́га ма́мы: ма́я, of May.
    highlight ans_og color #1a8a8a part ма́я effect underline

B: Most months add а: март, ма́рта.
    draw gen1

B: A soft sign or a й turns into я, and the stress jumps to the end: янва́рь, января́, as in в январе́.
    draw gen2

    erase gen1 gen2 ans_og

A: So восьмо́е ма́рта is the eighth of March: Women's Day, a holiday in Russia.
    draw ans8 tulip

    erase q ans8 tulip

A: It's the last day of April, and Tom asks Masha the date.
    draw people

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

B: Пра́здник is a holiday, and its д is silent.
    highlight talk_4_words color #c9871a part пра́здник effect underline

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk people

    show grid

A: Now just listen: Tom asks when Masha's dad has his birthday.
    highlight grid color #8f887c effect underline

A: А когда́ у твоего́ па́пы день рожде́ния?
    caption false

    ask "When is Masha's dad's birthday? Tap the month." voice b on ["m_sep","m_nov","m_dec"] correct 2
        gloss: Dad's? In November, in autumn.
        listen: У па́пы? В ноябре́, о́сенью.
        right: Ноя́брь: в ноябре́, in November, in autumn.
        wrong: Listen for the month after в, and the season.

    hide grid

    quiz "In May, in Russian: в …? Pick one." store q1 reveal.text "в ма́е" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 400 reveal.style label reveal.size 110 reveal.color #d0865f voice b test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: В ма́е: the й gives way to the place ending е.
        wrong: Ма́я means of May, for a date; in a month takes the place ending.
        * ма́я
        * май
        + ма́е

    erase q1_stamp

    quiz "The twentieth of June? Pick one." store q2 reveal.text "20 · двадца́тое ию́ня" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 400 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Двадца́тое ию́ня: the number as an ое word, the month in the of-ending.
        wrong: Two words change: the number and the month.
        + двадца́тое ию́ня
        * два́дцать ию́ня
        * двадца́тое ию́нь

    erase q2_stamp

    quiz "Сего́дня тридца́тое апре́ля. What is за́втра? Pick one." store q3 reveal.text "За́втра пе́рвое ма́я." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 400 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Пе́рвое ма́я: April has thirty days, so after the thirtieth comes the first of May.
        wrong: How many days are there in April?
        * три́дцать пе́рвое апре́ля
        + пе́рвое ма́я
        * пе́рвое апре́ля

    erase q3_stamp

    ask "Type the date in Russian: the first of May." answer ["первое мая"] store q4 default "первое мая" reveal.text "пе́рвое ма́я" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 400 reveal.style label reveal.size 80 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Пе́рвое ма́я: first as пе́рвое, and May in the of-ending.
        wrong: The word for first, then May in the of-ending.

    erase q4_stamp

    show masha masha_name

    ask "Ask Masha the date, out loud." say_it "Како́е сего́дня число́?" gloss "What's the date today?" voice a show cue test t1

B: Сего́дня пе́рвое ма́я.
    draw q_end a_end

    erase q_end a_end

    hide masha masha_name

    show grid

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    group recap members ["recap1","recap2"]

B: So a date is a number word in the оно́ form and a month in the of-ending: пе́рвое ма́я; and in a month is в with е: в ма́е.
    highlight m_may color #c9871a

    erase recap grid

B: А когда́ у тебя́ день рожде́ния? Say it out loud: в and your month.
    draw cake your

    erase cake your

B: Next time: ви́жу бра́та. Пока́!
    box next "Next: lesson 55 · ви́жу бра́та" #3d3833 say "ви́жу бра́та" x 500 y 400 width 640 height 100 radius 12 font_size 46 style.fill #fbf6ea

